Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: sherpa-onnx
Source: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
Comment: The orig tarball is the v2.0.1 release with the tarballs of the
 dependencies that CMake would download put at its top (kaldi-native-fbank,
 kissfft, utf8proc, kaldi-decoder, kaldifst, openfst, eigen,
 simple-sentencepiece, json, hclust-cpp); they are linked in statically.
 The checksums are those in cmake/*.cmake of the release.

